+#### Adaptive Volume Sampling
+- **Number:** On 1024x1024 resolution, ATI X1800 XT achieves 2.6 FPS (full) vs 7.1 FPS (adaptive); NV GF7800 GTX achieves 1.2 FPS (full) vs 3.0 FPS (adaptive). Speed-up: 2.6-2.8 [S2, unofficial].
